/T (Laura Sheeran is an Irish director and multidisciplinary artist working across theatre, film, large-scale public spectacle and music-led performance. Her work moves between institutional stages and independent production, combining rigorous structure with emotional and political clarity. Across long-form projects such as The Persona Project and her broader directing portfolio, she explores identity, embodiment, technology and collective experience through distinct, self-contained worlds.)
