/E (Chantal Muriuki is an Irish-Kenyan photographer and art director. With skills carried from her art studies and photography club in UCD, she specialises in fashion and street photography and visual storytelling. Chantal finds inspiration from her passion for fashion and video games and finds her muses from the dancefloor to the streets of Dublin. )
